== Notes ==

* Affected allies are actually [[haste]]d, which imparts the stated benefits as well as a +4 [[dodge bonus]] to [[armor class]].
* There is a limit of one creature affected per round of duration. (An [[extend spell|extended]] version can affect more creatures.) This might never be noticed by a player though, since under normal circumstances, the duration is at least eleven rounds.
* Whereas the level 3 [[Haste (spell)|haste]] spell is a [[transmutation]], this spell is an enchantment with accordingly different availability for specialist wizards.

